28
00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:16.290
叫什麼？

29
00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:21.510
model_name = 08_pretrained_vit，

30
00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:28.290
08 表示目前 Learn PyTorch 課程第八章，再接 feature_extractor，

31
00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:34.740
pizza_steak_sushi.pth，pth 是 PyTorch 模型檔常見副檔名。

32
00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:44.610
成功的話，會顯示儲存到 models/08_pretrained_vit_feature_extractor_pizza_steak_sushi.pth，很好。

33
00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:49.950
